  - reproducibility
abstract: >-
  Frozen Python implementation of the 3GPP TR 36.777 aerial channel annex over
  the TR 38.901 framework for UAV base stations, with 48 automated verification
  checks in five layers, the executed QuaDRiGa 2.8.1 cross-validation campaign
  (13,500 links at 2.6, 3.5, and 28 GHz; raw per-link samples, cell reports,
  and campaign log), two comparators, and the scripts that regenerate every
  figure and table of the accompanying IEEE Access article.
